KikasaTalismanLin: {
	DisplayName: Fine Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Faster rain beats, prolonged rainfall gathers into a drizzle veil; single drop damage -6%
	Origin: Jinan sees much rain, and the drizzle by Daming Lake often falls unbroken for days. The rain is gentle yet ceaseless, soaking through heaven and earth
	Power: "'Fine Rain': ink-rain tempo +20%; continuous rainfall for about 10 seconds enters 'Steady Rain': a fine veil of drizzle hangs beneath the umbrella, speeding tempo by another 10%; stops decay gradually, recalling the umbrella halves it at once"
	Burden: Drop direct damage -6%
}

KikasaTalismanLao: {
	DisplayName: Ink Puddle Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drops always pool into puddles on impact, puddles drink rain until overflowing to surge outward; direct hit damage -5%
	Origin: Water gathers in low hollows, and rain that lingers creates dead water. Still waters run deep, connected to unseen undercurrents
	Power: "'Pooling': ink drops always pool into puddles on landing, puddle duration +50%, coverage area +30%; drops landing in existing puddles raise the water level, absorbing three pours before overflowing, slapping out surges to both sides dealing 50% puddle damage each"
	Burden: Drop direct damage -5%
}

KikasaTalismanPei: {
	DisplayName: Downpour Talisman
	Tooltip: Faster inverted charging rate, full charge torrent triggers a heavy shockwave; steady rain tempo -8%
	Origin: When a cloudburst falls, the skies feel breached. Rain either stays withheld, or pours without reserve
	Power: "'Downpour': inverted charge rate +35%, ink geyser damage +20%; at full charge opening the torrent unleashes an area shockwave at the source, dealing 80% torrent damage and widening the deluge"
	Burden: Steady ink rain tempo -8%
}

KikasaTalismanSha: {
	DisplayName: Swift Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Umbrella readies near-instantly, first beat drops three swift raindrops in succession; interval after the volley +40%
	Origin: Sudden squalls strike unheralded, closing all avenues of retreat in a heartbeat
	Power: "'Swift Rain': umbrella deployment time -75%; the first beat always drops three swift raindrops in a row, dealing 75% damage each"
	Burden: After triggering the triple volley, the interval to the next beat is extended by 40%
}

KikasaTalismanYin: {
	DisplayName: Ink Bloom Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drop hits accumulate ink marks, detonating into burst damage at five stacks; direct hit damage -8%
	Origin: Concentrated ink dripped onto wet Xuan paper blooms along its fibers. Layer upon layer of bleeding marks must eventually burst the page
	Power: "'Ink Bloom': ink drops leave marks on hit (stacks up to 5, dealing continuous bleed damage based on stacks); at 5 stacks the ink blooms, detonating for 160% drop damage and clearing all stacks"
	Burden: Drop direct damage -8%
}

KikasaTalismanLu: {
	DisplayName: Sweet Dew Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drops occasionally condense dewdrops on hit, restoring life when gathered; ink rain tempo -6%
	Origin: Morning foliage gathers dew, water vapor sweet to the taste. Gathering clean dewdrops amid grim rain is fortune in itself
	Power: "'Sweet Dew': ink drops have a 12% chance on hit to condense a dewdrop, collecting it restores 2 life (at most 3 afield)"
	Burden: Ink rain tempo -6%
}

KikasaTalismanFei: {
	DisplayName: Lingering Mist Talisman
	Tooltip: Every third ink drop turns into mist, leaving a damaging slowing fog on impact; mist drop damage -30%
	Origin: When water vapor peaks, falling rain condenses into clammy fog. Those caught within lose their bearing, chilled to the marrow
	Power: "'Lingering Mist': every third ink drop becomes mist: leaves a fog lasting 2 seconds on impact, enemies within take continuous damage and lose 10% movement speed"
	Burden: Mist drop direct damage -30%
}

KikasaTalismanXian: {
	DisplayName: Scattering Pearls Talisman
	Tooltip: Heavy ink drops shatter into five leaping ink pearls on landing; puddle radius -15%
	Origin: Droplets crashing onto blue slate shatter into scattering beads. Seemingly small, yet leaping continuously to strike anew
	Power: "'Scattering Pearls': heavy ink drops shatter on landing into 5 fine ink pearls, each dealing 30% of the original drop's damage and leaping up to 2 additional times"
	Burden: Formed puddle radius -15%
}

KikasaTalismanXi: {
	DisplayName: Tide Talisman
	Tooltip: Puddles surge rhythmically toward nearby foes; puddle duration -20%
	Origin: Water flows toward hollows and ebbs with tides. Water holding tidal nature never waits idle, surging forth where currents lead
	Power: "'Tide': puddles gain tidal cadence: breathing and swelling, new drops landing in existing puddles surge toward the nearest foe, the wave crest dealing 50% puddle damage"
	Burden: Puddle lifespan -20%
}

KikasaTalismanZi: {
	DisplayName: Ink Soak Talisman
	Tooltip: Enemies lingering in puddles suffer deepening vulnerability; puddle base damage -25%
	Origin: Cloth immersed in dye vats drinks color the longer it rests. Things steeping in stagnant waters soften in their bones over time
	Power: "'Ink Soak': enemies standing in puddles stack soak stacks (up to 8 stacks), each stack increasing the ink damage they take by 2.5%"
	Burden: Puddle base damage -25%
}

KikasaTalismanTing: {
	DisplayName: Thunder Geyser Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink geysers erupt into thunder spouts chaining lightning; inverted charge rate -13%
	Origin: Stormy lakes by night are treacherous. Thunderbolts piercing the depths turn calm water into a churning sea of lightning
	Power: "'Thunder Geyser': geyser eruption height +50%, chaining lightning to up to 2 nearby foes on hit (dealing 50% geyser damage each); uncharged cascades also have a 25% chance to stir a small thunder geyser on landing"
	Burden: Inverted charge rate -13%
}

KikasaTalismanHong: {
	DisplayName: Rainbow Bridge Talisman
	Tooltip: Torrent leaves a rainbow bridge granting speed and burning crossing foes; torrent width -10%
	Origin: Clouds part after a storm, fleeting sunlight painting a rainbow across rising vapors. A transient phantom, gone in an instant
	Power: "'Rainbow Bridge': after pouring a torrent, a rainbow bridge forms over the landing zone for 5 seconds: granting +10% movement speed and +10% summon damage underneath; enemies crossing the arc take 40% torrent damage every 0.5s"
	Burden: Torrent width -10%
}

KikasaTalismanHang: {
	DisplayName: Night Miasma Talisman
	Tooltip: Night ink damage increased and puddles steam up miasma plumes; day ink damage -5%
	Origin: Old folk say night vapors rising from dead waters wound deepest. Cold humidity carrying a deadly chill leaves lungs aching
	Power: "'Night Miasma': ink damage +15% at night, puddles continuously steam up miasma plumes (dealing 30% drop damage every 0.5s)"
	Burden: Ink damage -5% during daytime
}

KikasaTalismanBao: {
	DisplayName: Hailstone Talisman
	Tooltip: Every fourth beat turns all drops into armor-shattering heavy hailstones; regular drop damage -8%
	Origin: Cold rain crystallizes, falling swift through clouds. Hail crashes through roof tiles and vats, stripped of all rain's gentleness
	Power: "'Hailstone': every fourth beat guarantees a full volley, all drops turning into heavy hailstones: size +60%, damage +120%, tearing enemy defense and knocking back heavily, leaves no puddles"
	Burden: Regular beat drop direct damage -8%
}

KikasaTalismanShu: {
	DisplayName: Timely Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Rain turns dense and healing for three seconds after taking damage; regular rain interval +5%
	Origin: Common tales call timely aid 'timely rain'. If rain arrives right when danger looms, it can truly turn aside a catastrophe
	Power: "'Timely Rain': for 3 seconds after taking damage, rain interval is halved and rain turns golden, each hit restoring 1 life (12-second cooldown)"
	Burden: Regular rain interval +5%
}

KikasaTalismanLong: {
	DisplayName: Scouring Falls Talisman
	Tooltip: Torrent becomes a raging deluge pushing foes away; torrent duration -20%
	Origin: Mountain flash floods tear downhill carrying mud and stone, unstoppable in their fury. No host can keep footing against such a rush
	Power: "'Scouring Falls': torrent turns into a raging rush: continuously pushing enemies along the fall line, source direct hit knockback +35%"
	Burden: Torrent duration -20%
}

KikasaTalismanShuang: {
	DisplayName: Frost Mirror Talisman
	Tooltip: Puddles freeze into frost mirrors, treading slows foes and drop impacts shatter mirrors into ice spikes; puddles cannot merge
	Origin: After late autumn frost, standing water freezes overnight into brittle mirror-ice. Smooth as glass, hiding peril beneath
	Power: "'Frost Mirror': heavy drops freeze into frost puddles on landing: no longer searing enemies, targets entering frost mirrors lose 40% movement speed; drops striking the mirror shatter it instantly, dealing burst damage scaling with remaining life and raising ice spikes"
	Burden: Frost mirrors remain separate and cannot merge together to extend duration
}

KikasaTalismanZha: {
	DisplayName: Rain Drum Talisman
	Tooltip: Hitting seven consecutive beats empowers the eighth beat to deal triple damage; rain pauses briefly after the heavy strike
	Origin: Storm rain pounding on taut oilpaper drums in steady rhythm. When the tempo never wavers, the final strike reveals its truth
	Power: "'Rain Drum': seven drum marks gather along the rim: landing at least one drop on each of seven consecutive beats empowers all drops on the eighth beat to deal 3x damage; missing a beat resets the count"
	Burden: After triggering the heavy drum strike, the next beat pauses rain
}

KikasaTalismanNi: {
	DisplayName: Tricolor Talisman
	Tooltip: Rain drops cycle through three attributes: red burst, blue slow, purple erosion; drop base damage -5%
	Origin: Paranormal waters shift unpredictably. Taking the fury of red, sluggishness of blue, and corrosion of purple, their cycle holds varied purpose
	Power: "'Tricolor': rain drops cycle through three colors: red drops trigger small bursts on hit (40% splash damage), blue drops slow enemies by 15%, purple drops increase ink damage taken by 5%"
	Burden: Drop base damage -5%
}

KikasaTalismanWen: {
	DisplayName: Cloud Script Talisman
	Tooltip: Talisman stars on the rim charge on hits, launching homing water arrows at full charge; rain interval +8%
	Origin: Ancient scrolls record cloud seal-script. Though mortals cannot grasp its full meaning, tracing its lines into talismans breathes vitality into water
	Power: "'Cloud Script': three script-stars orbit the rim, charging on drop hits; when fully charged the active star launches a homing ink arrow dealing 120% drop damage"
	Burden: Rain interval +8%
}

KikasaTalismanPo: {
	DisplayName: Moonsoul Talisman
	Tooltip: Gathers moonlight while open at night, releasing a pale moonfall torrent at full charge; completely ineffective by day
	Origin: In the dead of night, moonlight spills across deep pools like frost on water. Gathering this cool light under the canopy unleashes an icy cascade
	Power: "'Moonsoul': landing hits while open at night accumulates lunar phases; when full, the next inverted pour becomes a pale moonfall: torrent area +50%, hits inflict moonbursts (35% splash damage)"
	Burden: Completely ineffective during daytime
}

KikasaTalismanXiao: {
	DisplayName: Nine Heavens Talisman
	Tooltip: Canopy ascends to great heights, high-altitude drops gain immense speed and damage; rain interval +10%
	Origin: Eaves-drips only ripple the surface, but rain falling from nine heavens shatters stone. The higher the origin, the fiercer the fall
	Power: "'Nine Heavens': umbrella height is doubled, drops fall vertically from great heights: terminal velocity +40%, direct hit damage +25%, shadow rings telegraph impacts on the ground beforehand"
	Burden: Rain interval +10%
}

KikasaTalismanMei: {
	DisplayName: Mold Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drops inflict mold rot, infested foes release infectious spore clouds upon death; drop direct damage -10%
	Origin: Continuous plum rains leave江南 damp and sunless, mold blossoming across walls and trunks. Once moisture takes on decay, it clings like poison
	Power: "'Mold Rain': drops inflict 'Mold Rot' on hit (stacks up to 10, dealing continuous damage based on stacks); afflicted enemies dying burst into spore clouds, passing half their stacks to nearby foes with light damage"
	Burden: Drop direct damage -10%
}

KikasaTalismanPi: {
	DisplayName: Heavenly Thunder Talisman
	Tooltip: Short window after torrent pour allows drops to summon direct lightning strikes; geyser burst damage -20%
	Origin: Standing waters invite lightning under steamy swamplands. When water reaches its peak, thunder descends along the flow, piercing cloud and marsh
	Power: "'Heavenly Thunder': pouring a torrent opens a 10-second lightning window: drops have a 20% chance on hit to call down direct lightning strikes, dealing 180% piercing damage along the bolt"
	Burden: Geyser burst damage -20%
}

KikasaTalismanXia: {
	DisplayName: Twilight Blaze Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink damage surges at dawn and dusk with burning twilight flames; damage reduced at noon and midnight by 6%
	Origin: At daybreak and dusk, distant clouds burn like wildfire. Bringing this twilight gleam into water sets even the coldest rain ablaze
	Power: "'Twilight Blaze': within an hour and a half around sunrise and sunset, ink damage +18%, drops ignite 'Glowflame' for brief burning, dyeing the entire rain kit golden-orange"
	Burden: Ink damage -6% at noon and midnight
}

KikasaTalismanJi: {
	DisplayName: Clear Skies Talisman
	Tooltip: Holding umbrella gathers clear-sky light, recalling crashes down a ray of daylight at the cursor; ink damage -8% while open
	Origin: However dense the storm, clouds must eventually part. The shaft of sunlight piercing through when closing the canopy is the most dazzling of all
	Power: "'Clearing': landing hits while open accumulates clear-sky intent; the instant the umbrella closes, a searing beam of daylight crashes onto the cursor, damage scaling with gathered charge"
	Burden: All ink damage -8% while the umbrella remains open
}

KikasaTalismanYu: {
	DisplayName: Rain Dance Talisman
	Tooltip: Hits accumulate ritual points triggering Great Rain Dance with torrential downpour and geysers; regular ink damage -10%
	Origin: During ancient droughts, shamans danced to drums upon altars praying for rain. The umbrella serves as medium, the deluge answering as heaven's echo
	Power: "'Great Rite': drop hits accumulate ritual points, full charge entering a 10-second 'Great Rite': rain interval halved, drop damage +15%, all drops pool, geysers fully unlocked; ending with three geysers erupting beneath the canopy"
	Burden: Ink damage -10% outside the Great Rite
}
